{"asset_key":"ep2/herohub_story_12411170","episode":"ep2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"12411170","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1241117001:1":{"text":"No one who's visited Brineville and met my mothers hasn't been curious. Feel free to ask if you want!","source_cn":"没有人来过小水村，见到我的妈妈们后不好奇的，想问就问吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92F43DE622B5626D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1241117002:1":{"text":"I didn't expect Sinbad to have so many mothers taking care of him.","source_cn":"没想到，辛巴达竟然有这么多妈妈照顾……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE48103DBFA52DFCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1241117003:1":{"text":"Haha, do I seem like I grew up with no parents, struggling in alleyways and fighting beggars for scraps?","source_cn":"哈哈，我看起来像没有父母，在小巷子里摸爬滚打，靠和乞丐...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x769B25DC466C264B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1241117003":{"text":"Haha, do I seem like I grew up with no parents, struggling in alleyways and fighting beggars for scraps?","source_cn":"哈哈，我看起来像没有父母，在小巷子里摸爬滚打，靠和乞丐抢吃的长大的，是不是？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x769B25DC466C264B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1241117004:1":{"text":"Haha, no need to pull punches!","source_cn":"哈哈，没什么可避讳的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABC3A6A114093B85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1241117005:1":{"text":"It's true that I don't have real parents and bounced between different families. Nothing worth crying over, though, my mothers took great care of me.","source_cn":"我的确没有父母，从小吃百家饭长大，这不算什么，不必同情...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB03497487C94B65C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1241117006:1":{"text":"You already know why we moved from Rustport to Brineville. Even though they can't grow wheat here, they never considered moving back. Why do you think that is?","source_cn":"你已经知道我们为什么从锈锚港城里搬到小水村了，即使这里...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9998DABA8BB060FD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You already know why we moved from Rustport to Brineville. Even though they can't grow wheat here, they never considered moving back. Why do you think that is?","female":"You already know why we moved from Rustport to Brineville. Even though they can't grow wheat here, they never considered moving back. Why do you think that is?","variant_male_record_index":"137585","variant_female_record_index":"137586","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1241117007:1":{"text":"It's because they were worried that in a place where everyone would look down on us, I'd wind up as a lazy scoundrel or a violent thug.","source_cn":"就是因为担心在大家都戳我们脊梁骨的环境下，我要么变成一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5255B22FFC75EC61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1241117008:1":{"text":"But no matter what, it's wrong to take out anger on children...","source_cn":"但无论怎么说都不该把气撒在小孩子身上……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38DF36265362EC3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1241117009:1":{"text":"People don't usually use morals to control themselves; it's usually a weapon against others.","source_cn":"人们往往不会拿道德约束自己，道德这种武器一般都是用来约...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x885706A5CA65255D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1241117010:1":{"text":"Kids are pretty sensitive to both kindness and anger. If everyone around them is looking down on them, they'll start to believe they've actually done something wrong.","source_cn":"总之，小孩子对善意和恶意的感知都非常敏感，如果周围的人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B3100F6868D65D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1241117011:1":{"text":"This sort of guilt can crush adults, so what chance do children have?","source_cn":"这种负罪感连成年人都能压垮，更别说小孩了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B65CBA8353745ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1241117011":{"text":"This sort of guilt can crush adults, so what chance do children have?","source_cn":"这种负罪感连成年人都能压垮，更别说小孩了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B65CBA8353745ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1241117012:1":{"text":"While we were still living in Rustport, I would sneak out when my mothers were asleep and pay off kids who were bullying me with money I'd stolen.","source_cn":"还住在锈锚港的时候，我会趁妈妈们睡着，拿钱去给那些欺负...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFAAC88D277D9FAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1241117013:1":{"text":"Huh? Why is that?","source_cn":"哎？为什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CDEF774288C4747","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1241117014:1":{"text":"Since those kids believed my father was guilty, they thought I was too and put me in the same bucket.","source_cn":"因为那些孩子说我的父亲是犯了错的人，所以我也有错，不和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x748D4D199587A4B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1241117015:1":{"text":"If I wanted to play with them, I had to make up for my \"mistakes\" and find ways to make them happy.","source_cn":"如果我要和他们一起玩，就要弥补犯的错，想办法让他们开心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FC4068E96E23025","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1241117016:1":{"text":"It sounds crazy, but I really believed them back then!","source_cn":"很荒谬，但我当时真的信了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF59A053A97C3BB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1241117016":{"text":"It sounds crazy, but I really believed them back then!","source_cn":"很荒谬，但我当时真的信了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF59A053A97C3BB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1241117018:1":{"text":"Well, my mothers found out I was stealing and I caught a wicked beating.","source_cn":"我偷钱被妈妈们发现，被揍个半死。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x554B63631E102CD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1241117019:1":{"text":"Once they learned the full story, they took me away from Rustport the next week.","source_cn":"知道了前因后果后，她们第二周就带我从锈锚港搬出来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF26958DEA7488520","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1241117020:1":{"text":"That was the hardest I've ever been hit by them, as far as I remember.","source_cn":"那也是印象里她们打我最狠的一次。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x757A772AB2FD9901","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1241117021:1":{"text":"That's heartbreaking...","source_cn":"真可怜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE8A9D0D5CD80EEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1241117022:1":{"text":"Haha, even though my mothers seem pretty strict, they rarely laid a hand on me. If they did, it was just for show.","source_cn":"哈哈，我的妈妈们别看平时很强势，但很少对我动手的，就算...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA6A5293891AF60E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1241117023:1":{"text":"I think the reason they were so harsh that time wasn't because I stole, but because I believed what those kids said...","source_cn":"那一次打我之所以那么狠，我想……不是因为我偷了钱，是因...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3052C6ED6ADB8108","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1241117024:1":{"text":"—That my father and his crew were a bunch of cowardly weaklings.","source_cn":"——我的父亲和他的船员们，是一群胆小的懦夫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x432105C0F874C0BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1241117025:1":{"text":"Looking back now, I deserved that beating.","source_cn":"现在想想，确实该打。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12F22D0F9F45DF60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1241117026:1":{"text":"If I could meet the old Sinbad, I'd teach him a good lesson.","source_cn":"换我遇见了那时候的辛巴达，也会好好教训一下他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97EA1B94A8A11DA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1241117027:1":{"text":"I knew my father and his crew well, so why didn't I believe in them when others doubted them?","source_cn":"明明我很了解老爹和船员叔叔的为人，为什么在别人都怀疑他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4173D7B5B155031C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1241117028:1":{"text":"How heartbroken they'd be if they knew...","source_cn":"如果他们知道了，该有多伤心啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC45CC5FADC66159F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1241117029:1":{"text":"Sinbad... you did nothing wrong.","source_cn":"辛巴达……那也不是你的错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7C6A11FCAE9F643","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1241117030:1":{"text":"From that point on, my mothers understood the importance of finding the right environment for a child.","source_cn":"从那以后，妈妈们就知道环境对孩子的成长有多重要。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9BD655B21F6F9CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1241117031:1":{"text":"So even though the soil in Brineville is no good for crops, they never thought of taking me back.","source_cn":"所以即使小水村的土地贫瘠，连小麦都种不出来，她们也没想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4BABBF6C485EA06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1241117032:1":{"text":"You have some amazing mothers.","source_cn":"你的妈妈们是很好的妈妈。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1431352581EBE342","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1241117033:1":{"text":"Absolutely. They're the best.","source_cn":"当然。是最好的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E9746ABBE773B7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:20:0:1":{"text":"Tell me more.","source_cn":"后来呢","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x94599BCEF2CB0F6C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Tell me more.","female":"Tell me more.","variant_male_record_index":"66968","variant_female_record_index":"66969","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1241117017:1":{"text":"No, they tricked me.","source_cn":"没有，他们骗我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x209865387D4CA2F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:20:1:2":{"text":"Did they ever stop bullying?","source_cn":"他们和你一起玩了吗","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5F5AA5FE09609176","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Did they ever stop bullying?","female":"Did they ever stop bullying?","variant_male_record_index":"66970","variant_female_record_index":"66971","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:0:1":{"text":"Have you experienced that?","source_cn":"你经历过吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAC2D61FADCB299E2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Have you experienced that?","female":"Have you experienced that?","variant_male_record_index":"66964","variant_female_record_index":"66965","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:1:2":{"text":"May I know your story?","source_cn":"说说你的故事","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFBFE8597830AF18D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"May I know your story?","female":"May I know your story?","variant_male_record_index":"66966","variant_female_record_index":"66967","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"Well, sort of...","source_cn":"有点像","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x965E0E4A531573C0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Well, sort of...","female":"Well, sort of...","variant_male_record_index":"66960","variant_female_record_index":"66961","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:1:2":{"text":"We never said that!","source_cn":"我可没这么说！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB736657B8399FFD3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We never said that!","female":"We never said that!","variant_male_record_index":"66962","variant_female_record_index":"66963","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"Sinbad","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":43,"localized_text_count":42,"speaker_count":2}}